- lat (path, required): Latitude of the center point. {"type": "number", "format": "float", "example": 12.93}

- zoom (path, required): Zoom level. Values range between 0-23. Anything greater than 23, will default to 23. {"type": "number", "format": "float", "example": 15}

- width (path, required): Image width. Min value is 1 and max value is 2048. {"type": "integer", "example": 800}

- height (path, required): Image height. Min value is 1 and max value is 2048. {"type": "integer", "example": 600}

